{"title":"About","markdown":{"headingText":"About","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\nCoops&Co (former M31 Foundation) is founded by multidisciplinary director Robin Coops.\n\nCoops&Co creates music driven immersive experiences.\n\nWe search for the spaces in between to question the unknown.\n\nCollaboration is key.\n\nOften technology plays an important role.\n\n\n## Join the team!\n\nC&C is searching for a new business manager.\n\n[Click here](files/vacature-1pager.pdf) for the full vacancy.\n\nCoops&Co is gratefully supported by the local authority Rotterdam.\n\n![](RotterdamLiggend.png)\n\n## Boardmembers\n\n### Bestuur\n\n* Robin Coops - Artistic director\n* Frank van der Weij - Interim business manager\n\n### Raad van Toezicht\n\n* Sigi Giesler\n* Arnoud Noordegraaf\n* Eric Magnée\n\n\nRSIN: 853153942. \nKVK: 58722378\n\n\n### Beloningsbeleid\n\nHet bestuur is onbezoldigd en kan alleen daadwerkelijk gemaakte onkosten declareren.\nIn de statuten is opgenomen dat er een benoemingstermijn geldt van 4 jaar en dat een bestuurslid maximaal 2 termijnen kan dienen, conform hetgeen is bepaald in de Governance Code Cultuur.\n\nHet personeel en ZZP-ers zijn ingeschaald in de CAO Toneel en Dans.\n\n\n### Information\n\n* [ANBI](files/M31_standaardform-pubplicht-anbi-algemeen_2022_official.pdf)\n* [Jaarverslag 2024](files/Jaarverslag 2024_Coops&Co.pdf)\n* [Jaarrekening 2024](files/Jaarrekening 2024 - Coops&Co.pdf)\n\nStichting Coops & Co  \nWalenburgerweg 1d  \n3039AA Rotterdam  \nThe Netherlands  \ninfo@coopsanco.nl\n\n\n\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":""},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":"auto","echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-fil